{
  "kanji": "仲",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 仲\ntitle: relations between people\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 6\nradical: 人\nradicalNumber: 9\nonyomi: [チュウ]\nkunyomi: [なか]\ndistractors: [住, 伸, 使]\n---\n\n# 仲 — relations between people\n\n**Strokes:** 6 · **Key (radical):** 人 (no. 9) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n仲 concerns relationships between people. 仲 なか can describe how well people get along, and 仲間 なかま names a companion or fellow member. In 仲介 ちゅうかい, the character participates in the idea of an intermediary.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture a person 亻 standing beside [中](中.md), as if in the middle of a group of companions.\n\nThe canonical radical 人 appears as the left-hand form 亻.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| チュウ | on | 仲介 ちゅうかい - mediation; brokerage |\n| なか | kun | [仲](../words/仲.md) なか - relation; relationship; [仲直り](../words/仲直り.md) なかなおり - reconciliation; making up; [仲良し](../words/仲良し.md) なかよし - close friendship; close friend |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [仲](../words/仲.md) なか - relationship; terms between people\n- [仲間](../words/仲間.md) なかま - companion; fellow member\n- [仲直り](../words/仲直り.md) なかなおり - reconciliation; making up\n- [仲良し](../words/仲良し.md) なかよし - close friendship; close friend\n- 仲介 ちゅうかい - mediation; brokerage\n\n## Notes\n\n- 仲がいい なかがいい means people get along well. It describes a relationship, not their physical distance from one another.\n- 仲間 なかま uses the kun reading なか. Do not read that everyday companion word as ちゅうげん; that reading belongs to a different historical word.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1425710, 1425750, 1425790, 1426000, 1426100.\n\nUsage evidence: [Kanjipedia: 仲](https://www.kanjipedia.jp/kanji/0004728900).\n",
